	(42006,26972,0,406,33554464,98,-1,107,4294967295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,136410,1,'A New Threat','If you seek the Nexus, be wary. There are strange happenings in Coldarra, and it would be best to understand them before proceeding.

