	(47949,65299,8721,0,37748744,20,60,0,6130900294268439629,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,47946,0,151793,1,'That\'s Not My Fetish','<The glassy eyes of the pig fetish seem to follow you as you approach. The dark power emanating from the witch\'s fetish must be what is keeping the workers transformed. 

