	(47981,65299,8721,0,33554440,20,60,0,6130900294268439629,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,47978,47982,0,0,'Cracking the Curse','<In her haste, it looks like Helena left her spellbook behind. The pages of this book detail the ritual that she used to entrap the villagers of Fallhaven. 

